# SteamVRColourLab

Read [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) first. Generated files never go inside this
checkout.

- Output root: `../builds/SteamVRColourLab` (or `COLOURLAB_OUTPUT_ROOT`);
  `build/` for staging/caches/logs, `dist/` for the current package, `.venv/`
  for source dependencies.
- Build/test: `test_windows.bat`, `tools\Build-Portable.ps1`,
  `python -B tools\build_zipapp.py`.
- Run `tools\Prune-Portable.ps1` after a local build; `-Apply` only after review.
  Preserve `runs`, `settings`, the current package and validation evidence.
- Use `@steamvrcolourlab-build` for build or output-path changes and `@cavecrew`
  for delegation.
